{"ref": "Tosefta Peah 1:1", "heRef": "תוספתא פאה א׳:א׳", "sectionRef": "Tosefta Peah 1", "indexTitle": "Tosefta Peah", "heIndexTitle": "תוספתא פאה", "categories": ["Tosefta", "Vilna Edition", "Seder Zeraim"], "next": "Tosefta Peah 2", "sectionNames": ["Chapter", "Tosefta"], "versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Tosefta Pei'ah - Machon Mamre", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "http://www.mechon-mamre.org/b/f/f12.htm", "text": "אלו דברים שאין להם שיעור: הפאה והבכורים והראיון וגמילות חסדים ותלמוד תורה. פאה יש לה שיעור מלמטה ואין לה שיעור מלמעלה. העושה כל שדהו פאה אינה פאה."}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org", "text": "These are the things that have no set amount: the peah, the bikkurim, the r'iyah, charity, and learning Torah. Peah has a minimum amount but does not have a maximum amount. [If] one makes his entire field peah, it is not peah."}], "available_versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Tosefta Pei'ah - Machon Mamre", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "http://www.mechon-mamre.org/b/f/f12.htm"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Tosefta online", "license": "unknown", "versionSource": "http://Toseftaonline.org"}]}